    "notes": "Windows portable release with OCCT 8.0.1 and Qt 6.11.0.\r\n\r\n- Adds **Loft** (Czech **Přechod**) with owned planar 2D profile and guide Sketches.\r\n- Uses Loft-local placement, retains the last valid frame when anchors disappear, and exposes Sketch/placement dimensions during editing and double-click inspection.\r\n- Registers stable identifiers even for zero values, with editable quantities available to Relations and Family Table.\r\n- Places output type above Add/Subtract in Loft, 2D Sweep and 3D Sweep.\r\n- Adds localized numeric helper labels for direction (+1/-1), patterns, pitch and corrections. Aligns names to Extrude / Tažení, Twist / Krut and Drill Point / Špička.\r\n- **CLI change:** Feature side operations use `extrude`; `extrusion` input is rejected. Native document identifiers and user-authored names are preserved.\r\n\r\nVerified from immutable source `033f709d00e43c2a0a7a84a433a3561b6590a464`: 25 candidate and 21 fresh signed-package GUI scenarios pass. Both native smoke runs load all 1,185 factory documents and verify calculation/save/reopen, fonts and PDF/JPEG export. Exact source/resources, all 17,325 installed checksums, the OCCT 8.0.1 DLL closure and production updater trust pass.\r\n\r\n[Loft guide and geometric limits](https://github.com/ZIMA-Engineering/ZIMA-CAD/blob/main/doc/LOFT.md), [finite verification](https://github.com/ZIMA-Engineering/ZIMA-CAD/blob/main/doc/verification/20261024-loft-parent-origin.md), and [existing OCCT baseline failures](https://github.com/ZIMA-Engineering/ZIMA-CAD/blob/main/doc/verification/20261024-occt-801-upgrade.md) remain documented. Native Linux execution is unverified. Candidate 2402 was held before publication; 2403 includes its helper-anchor correction.\r\n\r\nPrivate settings, projects and edited library assets are preserved. The development launcher remains `zima-cad.bat`.\r\n\r\nArchive SHA-256: `6f89cbfa36c6e358f52a3ef4157f52eb837fd72329920e9879d9d9ac226406cc`\r\n",
